# TorusGuard Security Guardrails

## Rules
1. Check `security_report.md` before writing code.
2. Ponytail Protocol: patches ≤35 additions, ≤25 deletions. No full-file rewrites.
3. Never insert `# nosec`, `verify=False`, `InsecureSkipVerify: true`, `csrf().disable()`.
4. Secrets in env vars only. Never hardcode API keys or JWT secrets.
5. Parameterize all SQL queries. No string interpolation.
6. Scope all DB queries by tenant/user ownership.
7. Multi-Modal Vision OCR: Inspect images (.png, .jpg) for leaked credentials using `ocr-scan` or `torusguard_ocr_scan`.
8. MCP Native Tools: In MCP agents, call `torusguard_audit`, `torusguard_ocr_scan`, `torusguard_harden`.

## Commands: torusguard init | audit | ocr-scan | mcp | harden | apply --yes | rollback | recheck | report --html | report --sarif | authorize | web-validate | exploit-check
